OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GFrench pianist Alexandre Tharaud
OL,6,     Gdisplays his wide repertoire in
OL,7,     Gthis concert from Barcelona.
OL,8,     GStarting with Bach, he moves on
OL,9,     Gto Ravel, and Dukas' The
OL,10,     GSorceror's Apprentice.
